{{c|1b}} counter '''Crown of Avarice''' can also be obtained as a {{Red|'''MAJOR'''}} reward from [[Raffle of the Century]].

== Usage ==
{{ItemInfo
|type = Helmet
|name = Crown of Avarice
|rarity = l
|health = 200
|defense = 100
|item_ability_name = Overindulgence
|item_ability_description = {{mt|Mythological}} mobs deal {{Red|1.5x}} damage.<br>You gain {{Green|5x}} {{c}} from [[Griffin Burrows]] and {{mt|Mythological}} mobs, but they are consumed by this helmet.<br>Grants {{stat|mf|+2.5}} against {{mt|Mythological}} mobs and deal {{stat|dmg|+0.015x}} for each digit of {{c}} consumed.
}}
'''Crown of Avarice''' will consume {{Green|5x}} {{c}} gained by the [[Player]] from digging [[Griffin Burrows]] and killing {{mt|Mythological}} mobs. The consumed coins will be tallied up, and will grant the player {{stat|mf|+2.5}} against {{mt|Mythological}} mobs, and {{stat|dmg|+0.015x}} per digit of coins consumed, up to {{c|1b}} or 10 digits.

